sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户(协程/主流程)
    participant App as FiberApplication CSC_TASK
    participant AW as 各 Awaitable D2
    participant Sch as 主线程调度器 CSC_SCHEDULER
    participant Pool as FibersPool CSC_EXECUTOR

    U->>App: Coro::quit()
    App->>AW: invokeMethod(qApp,"aboutToQuit") → 各 Awaitable close(channel)
    AW-->>Sch: 挂在 await() 的协程被唤醒（pop 得关闭）并收尾
    App->>Sch: signalExit() 置全局退出标志
    Sch-->>Sch: 各线程常驻泵协程醒来看到标志 → 自行终止
    App->>Sch: drainUntilIdle(): processEvents + 处理 deleteLater + yield
    Note over Sch: 循环直到在途协程/事件跑净
    App->>Pool: block.close() + FibersPool.close()
    App->>App: QCoreApplication::exit()
    Note over App: 协程与泵协程均已收敛，避免退出崩溃/卡死